      "answer": "For two Spirits, put 8 Fear markers in the pool. Shuffle the Fear deck and use 9 cards: three, Terror II divider, three, Terror III divider, three. Shuffle each Invader stage separately, remove one unseen card from each, and stack 3 Stage I, 4 Stage II, then 5 Stage III cards. With a Blight Card, the initial pool is 2 per Spirit plus 1 total (5); without one, the board pool is 5 per Spirit plus 1 total (11). For the final setup action, reveal the top Invader card, Explore normally, then place it face-up in Build.",
